<div id="formulaPop" class="popup"><button onclick="closePop('formulaPop')">Close</button><h3>Formula Sheet - SMS 3314</h3><p><b>Single life:</b> qx = dx/lx, px = 1-qx | <b>Joint life survival:</b> tpxy = tpx x tpy (if independent) | <b>Last survivor:</b> tpxy-bar = tpx + tpy - tpxy | <b>Multiple decrement:</b> (aq)x = qx x (ad / (ad+aw)) approx | <b>Premium:</b> P = PV Benefits / PV Annuity | <b>Reserve:</b> tV = PV Future Benefits - PV Future Premiums | <b>Profit:</b> Profit = Premium + Interest - Expenses - Claims - Change in Reserve</p></div>
<div id="glossPop" class="popup"><button onclick="closePop('glossPop')">Close</button><h3>Glossary - SMS 3314</h3><p><b>Joint life:</b> status ends when first dies. <b>Last survivor:</b> status ends when second dies. <b>Multiple decrement:</b> can leave by death, withdrawal, retirement. <b>Decrement:</b> way of leaving. <b>Pension:</b> retirement income. <b>Profit testing:</b> projecting profit year by year. <b>Reserve:</b> money held for future claims. <b>Valuation:</b> checking if reserves are enough. <b>Annuity:</b> regular payments. <b>Assurance:</b> pays on death.</p></div>
