<h2>Topic 1: Revision - Life Tables, Annuities and Assurances</h2><p><b>Estimated time:</b> ~35 minutes | <b>Objectives:</b> Revise lx, dx, qx, life annuity, life assurance, premium.</p>
<p>Quick revision from SMS 3214. Everything in this unit builds on it.</p><div class='keybox'><p><b>Life table:</b> qx = dx / lx, px = 1 - qx.</p><p><b>Life annuity:</b> Pays while alive. PV = Payment x ax, where ax is life annuity factor.</p><p><b>Life assurance:</b> Pays on death. PV = Sum Assured x Ax.</p><p><b>Premium:</b> Annual premium P = PV Benefits / PV Annuity of premiums. Example: PV Benefits = 50000, PV Annuity = 10. P = 5000 per year.</p></div>
